{"id":"649153","name":"鲜虾炒马兰头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649153/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"几个"},{"name":"马兰头","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"马兰头摘洗干净。","img":"images/649153/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沥干水分备用。","img":"images/649153/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大虾这样剪。","img":"images/649153/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"能看出来黑色的部位就是虾胃，把它挑出来扔掉，虾全部处理。","img":"images/649153/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放大虾。","img":"images/649153/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"两面变色放食盐翻炒均匀。","img":"images/649153/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把背部立起来，煎一下。","img":"images/649153/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"全部熟透。","img":"images/649153/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放马兰头。","img":"images/649153/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒至马兰头几乎全部断生。","img":"images/649153/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切蒜末。","img":"images/649153/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放蒜末翻炒几十下即可。","img":"images/649153/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649153/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}